     00D0             (            os9.d):00836         FlMgr               EQU       $D0                 File Manager
     00C0             (            os9.d):00837         Systm               EQU       $C0                 System Module
     0050             (            os9.d):00838         ShellSub            EQU       $50                 Shell+ shell sub module
     0040             (            os9.d):00839         Data                EQU       $40                 Data Module
     0030             (            os9.d):00840         Multi               EQU       $30                 Multi-Module
     0020             (            os9.d):00841         Sbrtn               EQU       $20                 Subroutine Module
     0010             (            os9.d):00842         Prgrm               EQU       $10                 Program Module
